00:25:50,700 --> 00:25:51,580
你会看到这三种模式
These are the three patterns you’ll see.

465
00:25:54,620 --> 00:25:56,020
第一种，显然是趋势延续型
The first is, obviously, what we call a trend-trend.

466
00:25:56,760 --> 00:25:58,040
风险事件发生后
So the risk event occurs.

467
00:26:00,520 --> 00:26:10,631
