Events can be a central bank, economic data, and even a market release,

468
00:26:10,631 --> 00:26:21,519
比如财报发布，或意外财报——市场未预期的事件
like an earnings release or surprise earnings release—something the market wasn’t expecting.

472
00:26:23,240 --> 00:26:31,500
好，这种情况下，市场会以三种方式响应
Okay, now in this instance, the market can respond in three unique ways.

473
00:26:39,320 --> 00:26:46,000
首先是激进上涨，非常激进，大量单印区，未交易区，流动性差
initial rally, quite aggressive, a lot of single prints, untraded area, illiquid,

475
00:26:48,560 --> 00:26:53,000
然后是浅回调——几乎算不上反应，只是算法获利了结
shallow pullback—hardly a response, profit-taking from the algorithms, not really a response—

