00:27:12,060 --> 00:27:17,280
和第一种不同，上涨过程中流动性更充足
different to the first leg, more liquidity on the way up.

483
00:27:20,600 --> 00:27:33,420
第一种例子：流动性很少，所以市场先主动上涨
The first example: there's very little liquidity, so the market has an initiative leg up.

485
00:27:34,120 --> 00:27:42,460
遇到空头反应。卖方反应后退缩，只是分销
Runs into response. So, response of sellers backs off, just distributing.

487
00:27:43,820 --> 00:27:48,400
但我们仍保持主动性。市场可以继续延伸
But we hold the initiative effectively. The market can extend,

489
