An opportunity still exists, but it’s slightly less than the first example. Equally, the winners are smaller.

516
00:29:27,260 --> 00:29:31,900
第三种例子，你必须非常谨慎
In the third example, again, this is one where you have to be very cautious.

517
00:29:32,160 --> 00:29:36,960
这种情况下，市场先主动向一个方向，又反向主动
In this example, the market extends and initiates one way and initiates in the opposite direction.

